          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instructions shape behaviour. They never grant anything: what the agent may do is decided by its tools below and by your grants.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les instructions orientent le comportement. Elles n'accordent jamais rien : ce que l'agent peut faire dépend de ses outils ci-dessous et de vos autorisations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instructions written here": {
