          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It becomes a draft: analysed, tested in a sandbox, then shown to you before anything is installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle devient un brouillon : analysée, testée dans un bac à sable, puis présentée avant toute installation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It declares no permission. Each action that needs one will ask when it happens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il ne déclare aucune autorisation. Chaque action qui en exige une la demandera le moment venu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has no test. Add at least one test case.": {
